/* 训练考勤统计与排行（F1-B2）：复用 jg- 设计系统，本文件只保留名次徽标与“本人”高亮 */

/* 考勤榜的名次可能是“第 1 名”或“样本不足”，因此徽标用最小宽度而非定宽 */
.rank-badge {
  flex: 0 0 auto;
  min-width: 120rpx;
  height: 72rpx;
  padding: 0 12rpx;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  border-radius: 22rpx;
  background: #E9F1FB;
  color: #103A6B;
  font-family: 'DIN Alternate', 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace;
  font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  font-feature-settings: 'tnum';
  font-size: 24rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  line-height: 72rpx;
  text-align: center;
  margin-right: 20rpx;
}

.rank-badge-self {
  background: #FDEDE2;
  color: #B54A07;
}

.ranking-self {
  background: #F4F8FE;
}
